### LIMITATION / design question: a function cannot call a global function that
### is defined later, so mutual recursion is impossible even at top level.
### Fails with "'is_odd_r' is not defined".

fun is_even_r(n) do
    if (n == 0) do true else is_odd_r(n - 1) end
end

fun is_odd_r(n) do
    if (n == 0) do false else is_even_r(n - 1) end
end

assert(is_even_r(10), "bug: mutual recursion")

print("forward_reference fixed!")
